section.para:
The self-describing nature of JSON-LD enables a dynamic schema registration workflow.
          When the ONVIF Client Schema Registry receives a metadata event whose
            @context URI does not match any registered schema, it shall:

The data field of every EventOccurrence — whether delivered as a notifications/events/event notification on an events/stream response or POSTed to a webhook callback — carries a JSON-LD document. Every event document shall include:
@context — a URI pointing to the canonical LinkML schema for this event type. The ONVIF Client shall use this URI for schema lookup and for dynamic schema re-registration (see ).
@type — the event class name as defined in the registered schema (for example FireDetectionEvent). The ONVIF Client shall use this field for event routing.

section.programlisting:
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 8,
  "result": {
    "resultType": "complete",
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "get_status",
        "description": "Returns the operational status of the agentic engine.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {},
          "required": []
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 10,
  "result": {
    "resultType": "complete",
    "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "3 function(s) available." }],
    "structuredContent": {
      "functions": [
        {
          "name": "fire_detection",
          "enabled": true,
          "configSchema": "linkml://www.onvif.org/ver10/agentic/events#FireDetectionConfig"
        },
        {
          "name": "smoke_detection",
          "enabled": false,
          "configSchema": "linkml://www.onvif.org/ver10/agentic/events#SmokeDetectionConfig"
        },
        {
          "name": "set_event_keepalive",
          "description": "Set the keep-alive interval of the event stream.",
          "enabled": true,
          "executionSchema": "linkml://www.onvif.org/ver10/agentic#SetEventKeepaliveParametersRequest",
          "resultSchema": "linkml://www.onvif.org/ver10/agentic#SetEventKeepaliveParametersResponse",
          "capabilitiesSchema": "linkml://www.onvif.org/ver10/agentic#EventKeepaliveCapabilities"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 14,
  "result": {
    "resultType": "complete",
    "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Requested 1000 ms clamped to the device minimum." }],
    "structuredContent": {
      "executionId": "exec_keepalive_002",
      "appliedKeepaliveIntervalMs": 5000,
      "clamped": true,
      "affectedStreams": [30]
    }
  }
}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 20,
  "result": {
    "events": [
      {
        "name": "FireDetectionEvent",
        "description": "Fires when the fire detection function identifies a flame",
        "delivery": ["push", "webhook"],
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "zone": { "type": "string", "description": "Scene zone URI to filter on" }
          }
        },
        "payloadSchema": {
          "$ref": "linkml://www.onvif.org/ver10/agentic/events#FireDetectionEvent"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/event-stream

